{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1321111001:1":{"text":"打扰一下，工匠先生。你有没有非常向往的地方？","source_cn":"打扰一下，工匠先生。你有没有非常向往的地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x081D256707316A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321111002:1":{"text":"哈，要是有一个材料齐全、有各种最先进机械的研究所，我肯定天天窝在里面，指定能造出不少好玩意！","source_cn":"哈，要是有一个材料齐全、有各种最先进机械的研究所，我肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971E27617DAC240C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321111003:1":{"text":"怎么，雪松镇准备支持我们这群矮人的梦想，建一个机械研究所？","source_cn":"怎么，雪松镇准备支持我们这群矮人的梦想，建一个机械研究所？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D7C527BFEC9BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321111004:1":{"text":"啊……这倒不是，我只是随口问问。","source_cn":"啊……这倒不是，我只是随口问问。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91580581CAE3A0DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321111005:1":{"text":"我还以为你们突然开窍了呢，真是白兴奋一场。","source_cn":"我还以为你们突然开窍了呢，真是白兴奋一场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E85407821E8C54D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t